{"id": "striviaqa0085", "pool": "striviaqa", "arm": "local", "tier": "never", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 4252627796, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "81e2f23f98f19f1f63c3360e6be048d11083a3634e93068c14d5fdb8186e6ebb", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 1, "query": "Who was the last British athlete to compete in the Olympic 100 metres final?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/striviaqa0085.wav", "input_sha256": "b6b43160d40c687c145a569b6c2ffe27daf28b627808e461d6afb524769c3562", "input_samples": 64054, "input_s": 4.003, "n_real_chunks": 5, "score": 0.9433, "act": 1.0, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "The last British athlete to compete in the Olympic 1 00 meters final was Usain Bolt, but he's from Ja maica. So for Britain, it was Justin Gatlin, but wait— no, that' s not right either. Let me correct myself. The most recent British athlete to reach the Olympic 100 meters final was Dina Asal, but she's actually a middle distance runner. For the men's 100 me ters, the last British sprinter to make the final was Adam Gemili at the 2016 Rio Olympics. He ran in the semi-final and didn't qualify for the final, so technically he didn't finish in the final. However, if we look back further, the last British man to actually compete in the final was Dwain Chambers at the 200 8 Beijing Olympics. He finished fifth. After that, British male sprint ers have struggled to consistently break into the top three in the Olympic final s. So the answer is Dwain Chambers, representing Great Britain, who was the last British athlete to compete in the Olympic 100 me ters final.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_m